  pageClass: "audience-corporate audience-social-investors",
  eyebrow: "For social investors, funders and corporate foundations",
  heroTitle: "Back one mission. Strengthen several social enterprises. See the combined impact.",
  heroIntro: "Bridgit helps social investors back a group of trusted social enterprises around one shared outcome. Each organisation keeps its identity and expertise, gains responsible AI coaching capacity and contributes to one joined up impact story.",
