    { title: "Multiple access channels", copy: "Reach people through web, voice, WhatsApp, QR codes or the full Bridgit app." },
    { title: "Ongoing support journeys", copy: "Help people act through plans, practical tools, follow ups and warm handovers." },
    { title: "Shared impact reporting", copy: "See collective reach, need, action, connection and outcomes across the cohort." }
  ],
  gainsTitle: "What social investors gain",
  gainsIntro: "A focused delivery model that creates immediate support, stronger organisations and evidence for the next investment decision.",
